## intro
Tonight is the Thanksgiving party.
Difficulty: Normal.
The case: the Dragon Radar is gone from Dr. Briefs' desk in the Study. Nobody was hurt, and the thief is still at the party.
Theft: later in the night the thief hid the radar in a Hoi Poi capsule, in a party room they went to after taking it. Three capsules that look exactly alike are hidden in the party rooms: the other two are decoys, in rooms the thief never went to after the theft, and only Jaco can open them. Jaco wants who took it, the room it is stashed in, and when it was taken.
You have one hour before the case closes itself. Leaving the house or quitting closes it too.
Twelve people were at the party: Oolong, Yajirobe, Emperor Pilaf, Mai, Tien, Gohan, Piccolo, Videl, Krillin, Android 18, Chi-Chi and Puar.
The house clock chimed four times that night, at nine, ten, eleven and midnight. Every story is told by those times.
The feast filled the Dining Room. Somewhere there is a seating chart.
Where to start:
 1. Read your tablet: notebook. It lists every lead and where to go next.
 2. inspect cradle in the Study for when the radar was taken.
 3. Walk the house: question <guest> wherever they stand, search every room. You see only the guests at your own party; what they tell you is about your case only.
 4. At four findings (your notebook counts them), name who took it, the room it is stashed in and when it was taken: accuse <suspect> stash <room> at <time>, anywhere in the house, then accuse yes. accuse alone shows the words.
