## accuse
Accuse in one line, anywhere in the house:
  accuse <suspect> stash <room> at <time>
The room is where the radar is stashed: a party room the thief went to after the theft.
Suspects: oolong yajirobe pilaf mai
          tien gohan piccolo videl
Rooms:    grand dining family kitchen
          workshop menagerie conservatory
Times:    nine ten eleven midnight (or 9 to 12)
Example:  accuse yajirobe stash kitchen at ten
Short:    accuse yajirobe kitchen 10
Then accuse yes makes the arrest.
Findings: 11 of 4. Three wrong and the case goes cold.
## questioned
inspect cradle
The radar's cradle logs that the Dragon Radar left it between nine and ten.
question gohan
Gohan tells you, 'Oh! Sure, I can help. Here is where I was.'
At nine: "In the Grand Hall, with Emperor Pilaf. Just being polite, like I was told."
At ten: "In the Family Lounge, with Videl and Chi-Chi. Studying a little. Please do not tell anyone."
At eleven: "In the Robot Workshop, with Videl and Puar. I was talking to people, honest!"
At midnight: "In the Menagerie Yard, with Tien and Puar. Is it that late already?"
question pilaf
Emperor Pilaf tells you, 'The great Emperor Pilaf does not answer questions. Fine. Just this once.'
At nine: "In the Grand Hall, with Gohan. As befits an emperor!"
At ten: "In the Dining Room, with Yajirobe and Mai. Plotting nothing. Nothing at all!"
At eleven: "In the Conservatory, with Piccolo. Nobody can prove otherwise. Probably."
At midnight: "In the Family Lounge, with Yajirobe and Krillin. Do not question your emperor! Oh. Right."
