## answers
Oolong tells you, 'Oolong is an honest pig. Write this down exactly.'
At nine: "In the Menagerie Yard, with Puar. Minding my own business, for once."
At ten: "In the Menagerie Yard, with Krillin and Puar. I was not peeking at anything!"
At eleven: "In the Dining Room, with Tien. Pigs have alibis too, you know."
At midnight: "In the Kitchen, with Mai and Chi-Chi. I was eating. Pigs eat."
Over dinner you overhear Yajirobe and Emperor Pilaf: "Videl was never in the Dining Room with us at ten, whatever they say." "Not once. We would have noticed."
Android 18 tells you, 'I was wherever I say I was.'
At nine: "In the Robot Workshop, with Mai. Bored."
At ten: "In the Conservatory, with Tien. Do not make me repeat it."
At eleven: "In the Family Lounge, with Yajirobe and Krillin. Watching the party embarrass itself."
At midnight: "In the Dining Room, with Piccolo and Videl. Write it down. I will not say it twice."
